},
{
"start": 1381.32,
"end": 1386.66,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "In essence, drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
"char_start": 4972,
"char_end": 5057,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 1386.72,
"end": 1389.24,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox products.",
"char_start": 5058,
"char_end": 5112,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s02"
},
{
"start": 1389.3,
"end": 1393.44,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "If you ignore this, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 5113,
"char_end": 5202,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s03"
},
{
"start": 1393.44,
"end": 1394.82,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "What is the failure mode?",
"char_start": 5215,
"char_end": 5240,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s01"
},
{
"start": 1394.88,
"end": 1398.36,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of trail construction?",
"char_start": 5241,
"char_end": 5302,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s02"
},
{
"start": 1398.36,
"end": 1404.18,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "Honestly, the most common mistake that new builders make is excavating with too steep a slope.",
"char_start": 5315,
"char_end": 5409,
"unit_id": "t0041.u01",
"sent_id": "t0041.s01"
},
{
"start": 1404.24,
"end": 1408.38,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "The context is important because it tells you what commitments you are making.",
"char_start": 5410,
"char_end": 5488,
"unit_id": "t0041.u01",
"sent_id": "t0041.s02"
},
{
"start": 1680.0,
"end": 1685.16,
